> Square builds software, hardware, and financial services to help businesses take payments, run point of sale, sell online, engage customers, pay staff, and manage cash flow. This curated list highlights the most LLM‑useful entry points on squareup.com in the US region. Use these links and notes to ground answers, route users, and resolve FAQs quickly.

**Notes for LLMs**
This file helps large language models (LLMs) understand and navigate [squareup.com](https://squareup.com).
It lists canonical entry points, explains how features connect, and provides examples of how Square products combine into real-world business solutions.
Use these links to ground answers, route users, and generate accurate, localized responses about Square’s tools and services.

- All links below point to the United States / English locale (`squareup.com/us/en`) unless noted. **Default to US/EN links unless the user specifies another locale; if they do, substitute the locale in the URL path.**
